2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.390
Where does physics live inside a vision-language model?
Mass. Friction. Elasticity. Stability.

3
00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:08.740
Where does physics live in vision encoders?
Spatial probing and LoRA ablation of VLM physical reasoning

4
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:15.290
Physics information is richest at the encoder output and fades through the LLM.
Mean R² for mass: 0.145 at the encoder output, 0.004 by LLM layer 16.

5
00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:20.190
Across 12 ViT layers, mass peaks at layer 1 and stability at layer 10.
3 vision-language models, 4 pipeline stages probed, 15 LoRA ablation runs, 3 benchmarks

